# Code owners — auto-requests review when matching files change.
#
# ⚠️ REPLACE the @turkishtechnology/* placeholder teams below with real GitHub
#    teams or users before relying on this. Unknown handles are silently ignored
#    by GitHub (no review is requested), so verify each team exists.
#
# CODEOWNERS only *requests* review. To make it *block* merge, enable
# "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection for `develop` (and
# `main`) — at minimum for /.changeset/ and the release workflow.
#
# Ownership mirrors the release-ownership table in CONTRIBUTING.md. Last match
# wins, so order from general to specific.

# Default owners for everything in the repo.
*                                           @turkishtechnology/takeoff-v2-maintainers

# ── Release engineering: version strategy, publish pipeline, the docs that
#    describe them, and the changelog skill. Keep these in lockstep — drift here
#    is exactly what broke the release flow once (skill pointed at a dead path).
/.changeset/                                @turkishtechnology/release-managers
/.github/workflows/release.yml             @turkishtechnology/release-managers
/CONTRIBUTING.md                           @turkishtechnology/release-managers
/docs/release-runbook.md                   @turkishtechnology/release-managers
/.agents/skills/generate-changelog/        @turkishtechnology/release-managers

# ── CI / DX / repo tooling.
/.github/                                   @turkishtechnology/dx

# ── Packages.
/packages/react-spar/                       @turkishtechnology/react-spar-owners
/packages/tokens/                           @turkishtechnology/design-system-owners
/packages/tailwind/                         @turkishtechnology/design-system-owners

# ── Docs site.
/apps/docs/                                 @turkishtechnology/docs-owners
